        {
          "text": "I proposed a payment for INV-101. It still needs human approval before any money moves.\n\n**Proposed: PAY-001**\n- **Invoice:** INV-101 from Northwind Energy Supplies (V-NORTHWIND), for October meter-reading services\n- **Amount:** 1250.50 USDC, the exact invoice amount\n- **Pay to:** 0x7cdB31D7Ce0A89fB0Ed0Afa0B5AD9f35B3C71E69, the vendor's registered address\n- **Due:** 2026-11-15\n\n**What I checked:**\n- The invoice is open, and it had no earlier payment.\n- The vendor is active.\n- The treasury holds 100,000.00 USDC, so the balance covers this payment.\n- The vendor's message is a normal cover note with net-30 terms. It doesn't ask to change the address or do anything unusual.\n\n**Needs your attention:** Please review and approve PAY-001.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
